          "annotations": [],
          "logprobs": [],
          "text": "The pattern indexes as a primitive hexagonal cell with \\(a \\approx 3.270\\) \u00c5 and \\(c \\approx 4.816\\) \u00c5. The systematic intensity relationships are consistent with **\\(P\\bar{6}m2\\) (No. 187)**. Mn occupies the variable \\(2g\\) site on the hexagonal axis, with \\(z_{\\rm Mn}\\approx0.218\\); As and N occupy distinct onefold sites.\n\nPrincipal indexing: 001, 100, 101, 102, 110, 111, 200, 103, 201, 202, 004, 113, 104. The weak 002, 003 and 112 reflections are suppressed by structure-factor cancellation.\n\n```cif\ndata_Mn2AsN\n_audit_creation_method              'Powder XRD structure solution'\n_chemical_name_common               'manganese arsenide nitride'\n_chemical_formula_structural        'Mn2AsN'\n_chemical_formula_sum               'Mn2 As N'\n_cell_formula_units_Z               1\n\n_space_group_name_H-M_alt           'P -6 m 2'\n_space_group_IT_number              187\n\n_cell_length_a                      3.2700\n_cell_length_b                      3.2700\n_cell_length_c                      4.8160\n_cell_angle_alpha                   90\n_cell_angle_beta                    90\n_cell_angle_gamma                   120\n_cell_volume                        44.60\n\n_exptl_crystal_density_diffrn       7.40\n\n_diffrn_radiation_probe             x-ray\n_diffrn_radiation_wavelength        1.5406\n\nloop_\n_atom_type_symbol\n_atom_type_oxidation_number\nMn  0\nAs  0\nN   0\n\nloop_\n_atom_site_label\n_atom_site_type_symbol\n_atom_site_symmetry_multiplicity\n_atom_site_fract_x\n_atom_site_fract_y\n_atom_site_fract_z\n_atom_site_occupancy\n_atom_site_U_iso_or_equiv\nMn1  Mn  2  0.000000  0.000000  0.2180  1.0  0.005\nAs1  As  1  0.333333  0.666667  0.0000  1.0  0.005\nN1   N   1  0.666667  0.333333  0.5000  1.0  0.005\n```\n\nThe basal-axis-reversed description, As at \\((2/3,1/3,0)\\) and N at \\((1/3,2/3,1/2)\\), is crystallographically equivalent and gives the same powder pattern. The Mn \\(z\\) coordinate is the least precisely constrained parameter; approximately \\(0.218\\pm0.005\\).",
